# --- action-bias work line (Stage 0 / Stage 1) ---
# Raw per-event logs: ~86MB, already gzipped (so they do not pack down further), and fully
# regenerable by re-running the collectors. The per-turn CSVs and the analysis outputs derived
# from them ARE tracked, so every published number stays reviewable in the diff.
test_results/stage0*/mutlog_*.csv.gz
test_results/stage1*/**/seqlog_*.csv.gz
# Portfolio snapshots are binary GameStates whose serialization order is not byte-reproducible
# across JVM runs (see BuildV6Portfolio); the manifest is tracked and the build is deterministic
# from its seeds, so the set can be rebuilt exactly.
test_results/stage1*/_portfolio/scenarios/
test_results/**/_portfolio/scenarios/
# Raw stdout of the TBETS-vs-EMCTS runs: the per-turn CSVs and analysis/TBETS_VS_EMCTS.md carry
# every number, and the runs are reproducible from the commands documented there.
test_results/tbets_vs_emcts/*.log
# Transient run-lock + javac sources list
test_results/**/_running.lock
_srcs.txt

# Smoke/verify runs build a throwaway portfolio in the working directory. Only the scenarios/
# directory was ignored, so the manifest and journal beside it were staged by a plain `git add -A`.
test_results/stage1_smoke/
test_results/_shakedown/
logs/
ab_runs/
